1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:09,657
Claude or ChatGPT? Both are among the most popular AI assistants today, and both can do a lot.

2
00:00:10,107 --> 00:00:17,443
But which one is better for your work? Studying, writing, coding or making images?

3
00:00:18,543 --> 00:00:25,549
In this video we'll compare them in six rounds, and at the end I'll tell you who should pick which.

4
00:00:26,649 --> 00:00:33,974
First, a quick intro. Claude is made by Anthropic, and ChatGPT by OpenAI.

5
00:00:34,424 --> 00:00:42,448
With both you can chat, upload files and search the web, and both have memory and voice mode.

6
00:00:42,898 --> 00:00:50,050
So both handle the basics well. The real difference shows in the plans, and in a few specific tasks.

7
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:56,514
Round one: price. Both have a free plan, so you can try both without paying.

8
00:00:56,964 --> 00:01:04,131
ChatGPT also has a cheaper Go plan with higher limits than Free. It may include ads.

9
00:01:04,581 --> 00:01:14,699
The main paid plan for both is about twenty dollars a month: Claude Pro and ChatGPT Plus. Claude Pro is a little cheaper on yearly billing.

10
00:01:15,149 --> 00:01:25,665
For heavy use, both have bigger plans from one hundred to two hundred dollars. Always check the exact rupee price in your app, because taxes and offers keep changing.

11
00:01:26,765 --> 00:01:33,375
Round two: writing. Emails, articles, scripts or assignments, both write well.

12
00:01:33,825 --> 00:01:41,270
But many users and reviewers feel Claude's writing sounds more natural, and it follows long instructions carefully.

13
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:50,583
ChatGPT is fast and versatile, and great for short answers, ideas and brainstorming. A slight edge to Claude in this round.

14
00:01:51,683 --> 00:01:57,773
Round three: coding. Both write code, explain it and find bugs.

15
00:01:58,223 --> 00:02:07,093
Claude has Claude Code, which reads your project files and makes changes itself. In the last video we watched it fix a bug live.

16
00:02:07,543 --> 00:02:16,679
ChatGPT also has a coding agent called Codex. Still, Claude is very popular with developers for coding, so this round also goes to Claude.

17
00:02:17,779 --> 00:02:25,948
Round four: long documents. Say you have a hundred-page PDF, or a whole book.

18
00:02:26,398 --> 00:02:36,820
Claude can read a very large amount of text at once, up to a million tokens on some models. So summaries and Q and A on long files work very well.

19
00:02:37,270 --> 00:02:43,956
ChatGPT reads files too, but for very long documents Claude is ahead.

20
00:02:45,056 --> 00:02:49,945
Round five: images and media. Here ChatGPT is clearly ahead.

21
00:02:50,395 --> 00:02:56,751
ChatGPT can create images from text, like a thumbnail idea, a poster or an illustration.

22
00:02:57,201 --> 00:03:07,770
Claude doesn't generate images itself right now. It can make diagrams, charts and small websites in Artifacts, but for images, pick ChatGPT.

23
00:03:08,870 --> 00:03:16,713
Round six: extra features. ChatGPT has custom GPTs, small assistants set up for a specific job.

24
00:03:17,163 --> 00:03:27,072
Claude has Projects, Artifacts, Connectors and Skills. Both also have features like projects, deep research and scheduled tasks.

25
00:03:27,522 --> 00:03:33,650
For sheer variety of features ChatGPT is a little ahead, so this round goes to ChatGPT.

26
00:03:34,750 --> 00:03:41,041
So let's see the score. Claude leads in writing, coding and long documents.

27
00:03:41,491 --> 00:03:51,147
ChatGPT leads in images and features, and price is about even, with ChatGPT's cheaper Go plan giving it a small advantage.

28
00:03:52,247 --> 00:04:00,649
Now the key question: which should you pick? If you're a student on a tight budget, start with the free plans of both.

29
00:04:01,099 --> 00:04:10,235
If you write, code, or work with long files, Claude will suit you better.

30
00:04:10,685 --> 00:04:16,336
If you need to make images, or want lots of features in one app, choose ChatGPT.

31
00:04:16,786 --> 00:04:24,333
And if you're a content creator, many people use both: the script from Claude, the thumbnail idea from ChatGPT.

32
00:04:25,433 --> 00:04:32,832
My tip: ask both the same question and compare the answers. Within a week you'll know which one you like.

33
00:04:33,282 --> 00:04:41,986
And remember, AI can make mistakes, so check important information yourself, and never share passwords or private data.

34
00:04:43,086 --> 00:04:49,695
To learn Claude from the start, watch my Claude AI Complete Guide series, link in the description.

35
00:04:50,145 --> 00:05:00,095
Tell me in the comments which one you use, Claude or ChatGPT. If you liked the video, like and subscribe. See you in the next video. Thank you!

